<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "A virtual space is the map that belongs to a conversation: every channel has one, and so does every private conversation. Walk around the shared 8-bit world while the conversation carries on beside it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_space", "Opening Space")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The %{space} button next to the tabs puts the space's card in the conversation.",
    space: dgettext("chat", "Space")
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "%{join} on the card asks first, then opens the map in a browser tab of its own.",
    join: dgettext("share", "Join")
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The conversation stays exactly where it was, and %{chat} at the bottom of the space returns to it.",
    chat: "← " <> dgettext("share", "Chat")
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "There is no command for the map: the card is the door.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Joining and Moving")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Choose a character and you are in. Move with the arrow keys, WASD or the on-screen pad; the server validates every step, so the edges of the islands and the things standing on them block movement for everyone equally."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Talking")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The line along the bottom of the space is where you talk: what you type there is said in the conversation and pops up over your character."
  )}
  <.help_link topic="feature-space-talk">
    {dgettext("help_space", "Talking in a Space")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "The Construct")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "A green gate on the north island leads to the Construct."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The Construct is an empty room that the people of the conversation decorate together."
  )}
  <.help_link topic="feature-space-construct">
    {dgettext("help_space", "The Construct")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Who is there")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "A channel's space has room for everybody in the channel: members who have not opened it stand in it too, wearing the Hero, and count among the people inside. In a private space only the people who walked in are there."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Lifecycle")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The world itself is runtime state: it wakes when the first person walks in and stops when the last one leaves. What outlives it is the card that walking into an empty one posts in the conversation, which becomes the record of how long the gathering ran and how many people came. The address is a place and never expires."
  )}
</p>
